|| oṃ dūrgāyai namaḥ || āgnaya
<3a> oṃ vāyuve namaḥ || oṃ guruve namaḥ || uttare || oṃ paramaguruve namaḥ || oṃ parameṣṭhīguruve namaḥ || oṃ 
