<5b> oṃ dhūmravatyai namaḥ || oṃ krūrdhaṇī namaḥ || oṃ marddaṇī namaḥ || oṃ dhvaṃśinī namaḥ || oṃ vidyujjihve namaḥ || oṃ 
dūrāntakī namaḥ || oṃ vidyāntāya namaḥ || madhye || 
